        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>【Nemesis System】</strong><br>• Each knight has <strong>1 evolving Nemesis</strong> that adapts to your tactics<br>• Defeat them to uncover <strong>forbidden truths</strong> about the fallen Church</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 <strong>【Match-3 Tactics Depth】</strong><br>• <strong>Chain Combos</strong>: 3-match → 5-match triggers phase shifts<br>• <strong>Holy Infusion</strong>: Drag to convert rune types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ <strong>【Meta Progression Web】</strong><br>• Global level unlocks <strong>new heroes, dungeon layers, black market</strong><br>• 30+ relics <strong>break game rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A <strong>solo odyssey</strong> into darkness.<br>You'll witness—<br>• The Radiance Knight shatter from purity<br>• The Blood Oath Knight consumed by vengeance<br>• The Masked Knight forgetting his own face<br>...Now, it's your turn.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>【Nemesis System】</strong><br>• Each knight has <strong>1 evolving Nemesis</strong> that adapts to your tactics<br>• Defeat them to uncover <strong>forbidden truths</strong> about the fallen Church</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 <strong>【Match-3 Tactics Depth】</strong><br>• <strong>Chain Combos</strong>: 3-match → 5-match triggers phase shifts<br>• <strong>Holy Infusion</strong>: Drag to convert rune types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ <strong>【Meta Progression Web】</strong><br>• Global level unlocks <strong>new heroes, dungeon layers, black market</strong><br>• 30+ relics <strong>break game rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A <strong>solo odyssey</strong> into darkness.<br>You'll witness—<br>• The Radiance Knight shatter from purity<br>• The Blood Oath Knight consumed by vengeance<br>• The Masked Knight forgetting his own face<br>...Now, it's your turn.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
